      ],
      "text": "Aspexia brings the sheer force of her faith crashing down on a foe. If the next action she takes is to cast Harm to damage one creature, the target is knocked Prone if it takes any damage from the spell. If the target fails its saving throw against the spell, it also takes 3d6 persistent,fire damage."
